{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>今日（11月4日）大馬女神林明禎親赴真實賽車場，首度以乘客身分體驗極限飄移。</p>\n<h2>林明禎現身真實賽道體驗極限飄移</h2>\n<p>林明禎今日抵達賽車場時最初以一身專業車隊短袖上衣搭配休閒牛仔褲亮相，心情大好的她在維修區及賽道各處穿梭參觀，期間更親自搬運巨大的車胎拍照打卡。當她坐上安全車展開跑道奔馳體驗時，強大的甩尾動力令她緊張得雙眼緊睜兼擘大口狂呼，雙手全程死命捉實車內座椅。這趟極速狂飆帶來極強大的離心力，令她經歷了一場驚心動魄的極限旅程，直到車輛停下時仍未能完全平復激動情緒。</p>\n<h2>下車腳步不穩大換性感造型直呼瘋狂</h2>\n<p>經歷完震撼的極速體驗後，林明禎步出車廂時疑似被嚇至雙腿發軟兼腳步不穩，需要扶住車門稍作休息。不過她很快便重拾狀態，並迅速換上一身充滿野性力量美的火辣戰衣，大方展露招牌沙漏級極致小蠻腰。她隨後在社交平台公開這段經歷並寫道：「這是第一次在真正的賽道上體驗在賽道安全車內飄移，太瘋狂了！」</p>\n<h2>林明禎私下竟是超級賽車狂熱分子</h2>\n<p>擁有甜美童顏與極致身材的林明禎一直以充滿活力的形象示人，原來私底下的她是一位不折不扣的賽車運動熱愛者。這次終於有機會親自落場感受專業級別的賽道氣氛，對她而言無疑是圓了一個心願。即使剛經歷完嚇破膽的飄移考驗，她依然表示這次驚險刺激的旅程絕非終點，甚至親自宣告這一切「只是一個美好的逗號」，表明自己早已急不及待準備迎接下一次更強烈的極速挑戰。</p>\n<h2>狂暴離心力惹網民熱烈討論狂讚火辣</h2>\n<p>相關短片與相片曝光後火速在各大社交平台引發巨大迴響，大批粉絲對其大膽舉動感到驚訝。許多人看到她因離心力而失魂尖叫的真實模樣後，紛紛留言表示「睇見都覺得超級激動」、「完全感受到嗰股強大離心力」。同時，她換上露臍上衣展現水蛇腰的造型亦成為焦點，不少網民大讚「落車即刻變身真係好有型」、「身材同個賽車場一樣咁火辣」，對其野性與可愛兼備的魅力給予高度評價。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378522736491074_21399290546aeafd8c37d7f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1793453540_4020101760336716209_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378522736491074_21399290546aeafd8c37d7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523137030249_8238331326aeafd8fae1ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1793453540_4020101782172329225_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523137030249_8238331326aeafd8fae1ee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523460243166_7395991656aeafd92c7f6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261104000137887-1104_00862_001_07b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523460243166_7395991656aeafd92c7f6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523553779234_4919572796aeafd93d2849.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"minchen333_1793453540_4020101773154528093_202698442.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523553779234_4919572796aeafd93d2849.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523830488921_9802282726aeafd96806be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261104000137887-1104_00862_001_03b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378523830488921_9802282726aeafd96806be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@minchen333）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.909195+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1087,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:40:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:55.449919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:53.501608+00:00","content_hash":"d21bb75d02f76f9cb87220d9c18d52269c966dc805c9c735361e5c8f4813ac3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}